        "Metabot, aion2hub and allthings.how: one UTC+9 clock for every Global region (all three call it community-confirmed, not official). aion2atlas: each region's own clock (CET for EU, Eastern for NA East, Pacific for NA West). UTC+9 is kept; the owner check (To-do T-61 item 7) decides."
